cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you used Manusights to review your manuscript before submission, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Manusights"
abstract: "AI manuscript pre-submission review with live citation verification against scholarly databases (CrossRef, PubMed, OpenAlex, Semantic Scholar, bioRxiv, medRxiv), vision-based figure and image-equation analysis, and journal-specific desk-reject scoring. Designed to catch the structural, citation, and figure-trust risks that determine editorial triage outcomes before submission."
